==English==
===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# a [[stable]] [[suspension]] of small [[droplet]]s of one [[liquid]] in another with which it is [[immiscible]]
#:''[[mayonnaise|Mayonnaise]] is an '''emulsion''' where egg is used to keep oil and water mixed.''
#{{chemistry}} a [[colloid]] in which both [[phase]]s are liquid
# the coating of [[photosensitive]] [[silver]] [[halide]] grains in a thin [[gelatine]] [[layer]] on a [[photographic]] [[film]]

